Disney+ has released the official chronological viewing order for the "Infinity Saga" films. Here's how the list looks when watched not by release date, but by in-universe timeline:

- Captain America: The First Avenger;  
- Captain Marvel;  
- Iron Man;  
- Iron Man 2;  
- Thor;  
- The Avengers;  
- Thor: The Dark World;  
- Iron Man 3;  
- Captain America: The Winter Soldier;  
- Guardians of the Galaxy;  
- Guardians of the Galaxy Vol. 2;  
- Avengers: Age of Ultron;  
- Ant-Man;  
- Captain America: Civil War;  
- Black Panther;  
- Doctor Strange;  
- Thor: Ragnarok;  
- Ant-Man and the Wasp;  
- Avengers: Infinity War;  
- Avengers: Endgame.  

Note: The Incredible Hulk and Tom Holland’s two standalone Spider-Man films are not included, due to character rights restrictions.

